# Monotone ratchet ceiling for `cargo xtask lint-test-sleep` (bd rc-c9r6w,
# mission 139; mirror of ratchet-cancel-tokens.max, bd rc-pu2s).
#
# The integer below is the maximum allowed count of unadjudicated
# sleep calls (tokio::time::sleep / std::thread::sleep) in test
# function bodies across crates/, scripts/, examples/, benchmarks/,
# fuzz/. Sites marked `// allow-test-sleep: <reason>` are suppressed
# at scan time and never count toward the ceiling. The number may
# only DECREASE — never raise it without review justification; the
# diff on this file is the regression signal.
#
# To lower it: fix sites (run `cargo xtask lint-test-sleep` — over a
# lowered ceiling it names every offender), then edit the number down
# to the new count and drop the fixed entries below.
#
# Starter burn-down (mission 139, 2026-09-19): the 3 most-touched
# files (git-log frequency) were adjudicated — 2 padding sleeps
# removed, 1 converted to a deadline-bounded wait, 5 sites marked
# allow-test-sleep; ceiling 478 -> 470.
